<title>USA: Most IMM currency futures begin slightly lower.</title>
<headline>Most IMM currency futures begin slightly lower.</headline>
<text>
<p>July 21 - Most IMM currencies opened lower. Dollar eyes French audit statement showing French '97 budget deficit to GDP seen at 3.1 to 3.3 pct. U.S. economic line-up empty Monday, all eyes on Greenspan testimony Tuesday. Treasuries begin weak, traders also await stocks open after Dow drop Friday.</p>
<p>((Chicago Derivatives Desk (312)408-8750))</p>
